---
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-24 w-full z-10">
  <!-- Background Glow - Sinkron dengan Hero -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-40 w-100 h-100 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
    
    <!-- Bagian Kiri: Teks Narasi -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-sky-400 uppercase">
          <span class="lang-id">Tentang Saya</span>
          <span class="lang-en">About Me</span>
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-id">Mengubah Baris Kode Menjadi <br /></span>
          <span class="lang-en">Transforming Lines of Code into <br /></span>
          <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-500 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            <span class="lang-id">Pengalaman Digital.</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Digital Experiences.</span>
          </span>
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium">
        <p class="lang-id">
          Halo! Saya seorang pengembang perangkat lunak muda yang sedang menempuh pendidikan di jurusan 
          <span class="text-zinc-200 font-semibold italic">Pengembangan Perangkat Lunak dan GIM (PPLG)</span>. 
          Ketertarikan saya pada dunia teknologi dimulai dari rasa penasaran bagaimana sebuah website estetis dibangun.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-en">
          Hello! I'm a young software developer currently pursuing an education in 
          <span class="text-zinc-200 font-semibold italic">Software Engineering (PPLG)</span>. 
          My interest in technology began with a curiosity about how aesthetic websites are built.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-id">
          Fokus utama saya saat ini adalah menjembatani celah antara <span class="text-sky-400">desain visual yang memukau</span> dan 
          <span class="text-blue-400">fungsionalitas kode yang bersih</span>. Saya percaya bahwa setiap pixel memiliki tujuan dan 
          setiap baris kode harus memberikan dampak bagi pengguna.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-en">
          My main focus now is to bridge the gap between <span class="text-sky-400">stunning visual design</span> and 
          <span class="text-blue-400">clean code functionality</span>. I believe every pixel has a purpose and 
          every line of code should make an impact for the user.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Stack Badges -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4">
        {['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'React', 'JavaScript', 'Figma', 'Nuxt', 'Vue', 'Golang'].map((skill) => (
          <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 text-sm font-medium hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all duration-300">
            {skill}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bagian Kanan: Highlight Cards -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1: UI/UX Mindset -->
      <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-sky-500/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-sky-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.172-1.172a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L15 13" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
            <span class="lang-id">Desain Berbasis Pengguna</span>
            <span class="lang-en">User-Centric Design</span>
          </h4>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <span class="lang-id">Fokus pada kenyamanan dan kemudahan navigasi bagi setiap pengguna yang berkunjung.</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Focusing on comfort and ease of navigation for every visiting user.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Technical Excellence -->
      <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">
            <span class="lang-id">Performa Maksimal</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Maximum Performance</span>
          </h4>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <span class="lang-id">Membangun website yang cepat, ringan, dan dioptimalkan untuk mesin pencari (SEO).</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Building fast, lightweight websites optimized for search engines (SEO).</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mini Stats / Social Links Box -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900/40 border border-zinc-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-around transition-all duration-500 hover:border-blue-500/20 shadow-inner">
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-white">2+</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-zinc-500">
            <span class="lang-id">Tahun Belajar</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Years Learning</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-8 w-px bg-zinc-800"></div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-white">10+</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-zinc-500">
            <span class="lang-id">Proyek Selesai</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Projects Done</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-8 w-px bg-zinc-800"></div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-white">PPLG</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-zinc-500">
            <span class="lang-id">Kompetensi</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Competency</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>